      "role": "user",
      "content": "groundbreaking? i mean, i don't know if it's that, but it's definitely weird. you mentioned intentional modulation... how would that actually work from a physics standpoint? like, how would you encode data into an ionospheric resonance so that it stays focused on a specific building instead of just spreading out everywhere?",
